144 Religious Numeration
------------------------------------------------------------
228.06 — Symbolism in Revelation (Apocalyptic numeration)

CLAIM
------------------------------------------------------------
People often treat “144” as a mystical or destiny‑coded number.
But the cultural obsession with 144 comes from religious 
apocalyptic literature.

SOURCE OF THE OBSESSION
============================================================
144 → 12 × 12 → “144,000”  
This number appears in the Book of Revelation as a symbolic
count of “sealed” individuals. That text created centuries of
numerical fixation.

============================================================
Apocalyptic symbolism → culturally loaded integers (7, 12, 40, 144, 666)

- use symbolic numbers,
- use reduction or factorization,
- use archetypal interpretation.

STRUCTURAL DISTINCTION
============================================================
Numerology:
    mode_k : person → thematic tendencies
    reduction: N → sum_of_digits(N)

Apocalyptic number symbolism:
    number → theological metaphor
    no reduction; integer itself is symbolic

    144 religious‑symbolic integers

============================================================
CONCLUSION
============================================================
The obsession with 144 is:
    - theological,
    - apocalyptic,
    - symbolic in a religious tradition
